  "description": "The all-new F-Trick full suspension range, has so many things in common with the high-end adult bikes that we’re hard pressed to call it a kids bike. Forward Geometry, the Updated Zero Suspension System, 120mm and 130mm travel, dropper posts, 12x148mm drop-outs, 30mm stems, 4 piston brakes and 2.4” tyres. It’s enough to leave you out of breath. Picking up the baton from the old Factor range, the F-Trick comes in 24” and 26” flavours. As such the F-Trick 24” is perfect for kids from 8 to 11 years old (135-155cm) and the F-Trick 26” suits anyone from 10 to 14 years old (145-165cm).",
